Count the Number of Vowels in a String

Exercise:
Count how many vowels appear in a string.

Consider:

a, e, i, o, u

Example:

Input:  "javascript"

Output: 3


Solution:


let str = "javascript";

str = str.toLowerCase();

const vowels = new Set(["a", "e", "i", "o", "u"]);
let count = 0;

for (let i = 0; i < str.length; i++) {
  if (vowels.has(str[i])) {
    count += 1;
  }
}

console.log(count);
